<title>UK: Sole Brent date kept, heard resold - traders.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent date kept, heard resold - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sole Brent date nominated from the paper chains on Wednesday was kept, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, loading Dec 19-21, was kept by trading house Phibro and then heard resold at Jan Brent +49 cents, although this was unconfirmed.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
